  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Justice Sector 2021-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new suite of regional support to the Pacific justice sector, consolidating previous activities to strengthen the formal and informal justice sectors. Support&#xa0;areas include: access to justice; case management and efficiency; reporting and transparency; capacity and access development (including targeted support for women in the judiciary); and human rights. This Activity will provide opportunities for increased coordination and a strengthened NZ Inc. presence in this important sector.</narrative>
  </description>
